    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/6044cfe7abe702dd0239cf73be27432e.webp?t=1749334579\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ROBO SHAM BORO  </strong>is a rock paper scissors deckbuilder card battler JRPG.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as this guy named Dillinger, a spry young man caught up in the biggest conspiracy this side of the Old Road.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That's right, there's murder afoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, it <i>might</i> have been a murder. It could have also just been a beast attack, like a bear or a moose or something. But it might have also been a murder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Anyways, smart guy, I know that it's December 25th and all, but could you on a wacky adventure full of personal growth to figure this one out for us? I'm sure you've got nothing else going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/9440932face36f8b70d63d83a0173a3d.poster.avif?t=1749334579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/9440932face36f8b70d63d83a0173a3d.webm?t=1749334579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/9440932face36f8b70d63d83a0173a3d.mp4?t=1749334579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features of <strong>ROBO SHAM BORO</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270a Rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Paper</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u270c\ufe0f Scissors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/d17dcb736d4905494d41ffc6cd969641.poster.avif?t=1749334579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/d17dcb736d4905494d41ffc6cd969641.webm?t=1749334579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/d17dcb736d4905494d41ffc6cd969641.mp4?t=1749334579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yeah, you heard me right, mouth-breather.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've got\u00a0\u270a Rock,\u00a0\ud83d\udd90\ufe0f Paper, <i>AND</i>\u00a0\u270c\ufe0f Scissors. Play your CARDS right, because every time you do your SIGN changes to match it. You'll have to play smart and manage your resources to avoid opening yourself up to deadly crits, and take advantage of the enemy's SIGN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>But I'm not done yet! </i>More features of <strong>ROBO SHAM BORO:</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udccf DECKBUILDING</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/c0de16ffdd439a515697300c9385c907.poster.avif?t=1749334579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/c0de16ffdd439a515697300c9385c907.webm?t=1749334579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/c0de16ffdd439a515697300c9385c907.mp4?t=1749334579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether your deck's full of random crap or an <i>actual build</i>, it's on you to stack the deck in your favor and come out on top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Nothing is stopping you from bringing 30 \ud83d\udd90\ufe0fMysteries, however. Don't be a coward.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">But get this, there's even more to this game! Like:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0 </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/69b051ce53bc8c7819cc7002b3940702.poster.avif?t=1749334579\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/69b051ce53bc8c7819cc7002b3940702.webm?t=1749334579\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/69b051ce53bc8c7819cc7002b3940702.mp4?t=1749334579\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sorry that's all I got actually</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721840/extras/6044cfe7abe702dd0239cf73be27432e.webp?t=1749334579\" /></div></p></li></ul>",
